```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Email Notification</title>
</head>

<body style="
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      color: #343a40;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 20px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    ">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <img src="<%= logo %>" alt="<%= name %>" style="max-height: 64px; margin-bottom: 20px;" />

    <h1 style="
        color: #b91c1c;
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin: 0;
      ">
      <%= name %>
    </h1>
  </div>

  <!-- Content -->
  <div style="
      background-color: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      border: 1px solid #e9ecef;
    ">

    <h2 style="
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-top: 0;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      ">
      Hello <%= client %>,
    </h2>

    <p style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
      We hope this email finds you well. Please verify your email address to
      complete your registration.
    </p>

    <p style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
      To verify your email address, please click the button below:
    </p>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
      <a href="<%= url %>" style="
          background-color: #b91c1c;
          color: #ffffff;
          padding: 14px 28px;
          text-decoration: none;
          border-radius: 6px;
          display: inline-block;
          font-weight: bold;
          font-size: 16px;
        ">
        Verify Email Address
      </a>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
      If the button above doesn't work, you can also copy and paste this link
      into your browser:
    </p>

    <p style="
        color: #b91c1c;
        word-break: break-word;
        margin-bottom: 0;
      ">
      <%= url %>
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <div style="
      border-top: 1px solid #dee2e6;
      padding-top: 24px;
      color: #6c757d;
      font-size: 14px;
    ">

    <p style="
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #343a40;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      ">
      Need Help?
    </p>

    <p style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
      If you have any questions or need assistance, please don't hesitate to
      contact our support team at
      <a href="mailto:<%= support %>" style="
          color: #b91c1c;
          text-decoration: none;
          font-weight: 500;
        ">
        <%= support %>
      </a>
    </p>

    <p style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
      Best regards,<br />
      The <%= name %> Team
    </p>

    <div style="
        padding-top: 16px;
        border-top: 1px solid #dee2e6;
        color: #6c757d;
        font-size: 13px;
      ">
      <p>
        <%= name %><br />
          <%= address %>
      </p>

      <p style="margin-top: 16px;">
        This email was sent to <%= email %>. If you received this email in
          error, please ignore it.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

</body>

</html>
```